      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Research_pilot_and_former_astronaut_Gordon_Fullerton_is_congratulated_by_retired_astronaut_Fred_Haise_upon_Fullerton%27s_induction_into_the_Astronaut_Hall_of_Fame_(ED05-0095-02).jpg",
      "width": 3000,
